maintenance. The demo was unpublished at the initial review; a later experimental prerelease is…</p><details class="archive-record" id="cloud-evidence-20261108-record"><summary>Read the archived notice</summary><p class="archive-history-label">Historical notice, including existing corrections</p><div class="archive-original"><section id="original-cloud-evidence-20261108" class="status"><h2>VSO reports ten merged cloud-evidence and maintenance updates</h2><p>Ten merged PRs cover cloud-evidence research, interop release preparation, Explorer dependency maintenance, local-settings guards and incident-source records. PR #61 is release preparation and was unpublished at the initial review. A later experimental prerelease at 12:09 JST on 8 November is recorded separately in the linked article. The research is unadopted; independent reproduction is not established. Test and CI records are first-party checks, not independent confirmation.</p><p>All cloud experiments are synthetic and operated by the same party; no live cloud calls were made. They do not prove Azure origin, complete observation, independent custody, latestness, third-party timestamps, power-loss durability or production readiness. A valid older snapshot can remain valid without a separately retained contradictory checkpoint. Verification of custody does not grant permission to publish evidence. First-party CI is not independent reproduction.</p><p><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-08-cloud-evidence-maintenance-update/">Read the ten updates, CI and limitations</a></p></section></div></details></div></li><li class="news-row" id="payment-research-20261107" data-news-record data-month="2026-11" data-category="research"><div class="news-meta"><time datetime="2026-11-07">2026-11-07</time></div><div><h3><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-07-payment-evidence-research-update/">VSO publishes seven VAP payment-evidence research and AI design updates</a></h3><p class="news-summary">VAP #52–#58 cover payment evidence, dispatch recovery, two-person approval and collection, plus school-AI and consumer-agent design notes. First-party CI only; unadopted,…</p><details class="archive-record" id="payment-research-20261107-record"><summary>Read the archived notice</summary><p class="archive-history-label">Historical notice, including existing corrections</p><div class="archive-original"><section id="original-payment-research-20261107" class="status"><h2>VSO publishes seven VAP payment-evidence research and AI design updates</h2><p>VAP #52–#58 were merged on 6 November. First-party payment-research CI checked 57 offline-evidence, 28 dispatch/recovery, 20 authorization and 25 collector tests separately. School-AI and consumer-agent updates are documents; the latter’s eight review cases are unexecuted. Extensions and proposals remain unadopted; independent reproduction is not established.</p><p>All experiments use first-party synthetic environments. A holder of raw mock-provider credentials can bypass the wrapper. Complete route coverage, independent custody, external anchoring, OS privilege separation and full proposal conformance are not established. A signed ACK does not prove truth, completeness or continuing retention.</p><p><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-07-payment-evidence-research-update/">Read the seven updates, CI and limitations</a></p></section></div></details></div></li><li class="news-row" id="research-sdk-20261105" data-news-record data-month="2026-11" data-category="research"><div class="news-meta"><time datetime="2026-11-05">2026-11-05</time></div><div><h3><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-05-vap-research-sdk-reproduction/">VAP research, SDK updates and external reproduction notes</a></h3><p class="news-summary">5 Nov: a18cda8 site CI completed (110 image comparisons; 55 regression tests). Research remains unadopted; independent reproduction is not established.</p><details class="archive-record" id="research-sdk-20261105-record"><summary>Read the archived notice</summary><p class="archive-history-label">Historical notice, including existing corrections</p><div class="archive-original"><section id="original-research-sdk-20261105" class="status"><h2>VAP research, SDK updates and external reproduction notes</h2><p>Merged research separates control observations, wallet authorization and execution evidence. SDK fixes and reproduction notes are available; independent reproduction is not established.</p><p>Experimental extensions remain unadopted; independent third-party reproduction has not been established. The results below are first-party CI and internal research checks, not an independent assessment, certification, production-readiness determination or proof of complete observation.</p><p><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-05-vap-research-sdk-reproduction/">Read the update and source records</a></p><div id="original-main-ci-20261105"><h3>5 November follow-up: site main CI completed</h3><p>Website main <code>a18cda8</code> completed all five workflows and 12 jobs, including 110 image comparisons, 55 regression tests and a 428-page CSP crawl. Chinese VeraSnap image pairs matched exactly at desktop and mobile widths. Comparison criteria were not relaxed.</p><p>This is first-party website CI, not an independent reproduction result. Experimental extensions remain unadopted; independent reproduction is not established. Historical test records remain attached to their original revisions.</p><p><a href="https://veritaschain.org/vso/announcements/2026-11-05-vap-research-sdk-reproduction/#main-ci-20261105">Read the main CI completion results and scope</a></p></div></section></div></details></div></li><li class="news-row" id="github-corrections-20261103" data-news-record data-month="2026-11" data-category="research"><div class="news-meta"><time datetime="2026-11-03">2026-11-03</time></div><div><h3><a href="https://verita